  "solution": "**Given: **28 : 66 :: 31 : ?\n\n28 : 66\n\n⇒ 28 × 3 – (28 – 10)\n\n⇒ 84 – 18\n\n⇒ 66\n\nSimilarly,\n\n**31 : ?**\n\n**⇒ 31 × 3 – (31 – 10)**\n\n**⇒ 93 – 21**\n\n**⇒ 72**\n\n**∴ The required number is 72.**",
